+
+Each activation below is a **cost-1 Basic Action, out of Combat**. It flips the Quest card into its active Item; a Room Malfunction does not prevent this activation. Using the active Item is a separate Action, also **cost 1 and out of Combat** for these examples.
+
+| Quest Item | Activation location | Active Item effect |
+|---|---|---|
+| Pilot's Evacuation Key | Fire Control System Room | In an **Evacuation Section Room**, Lock or Unlock **1 Pod in that Section**. **One Use Only**: discard after use. It is neither remote nor reusable. |
+| Captain's Log Key | Comms Room | In a Room with an **available Computer**, look at the retained Objective cards of a chosen player; their Character need not share your Room. **One Use Only**: discard after use. A Malfunction makes the Computer unavailable even though it did not prevent activation. |
+| Mechanic's Plasma Torch | Storage Room | Open or Close **1 Door in a Corridor connected to your Room**; this Item can Close a **Destroyed** Door. It is reusable (not marked One Use Only). |
